  m_Name: CameraShakeCard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: xpTURN.Feedback.Samples::xpTURN.Feedback.Samples.SampleCard
  Title: Camera Shake Lab
  Try: Press 1 2 3 for the presets on the left screen, Z X to shake one screen, C
    V to keep a screen shaking.
  See: One player per button. The presets aim at the main camera (the left screen);
    the right screen hears channel 2. An endless shake adds under a preset and stops
    at once; switched on in Before it starts at After.
  Controls: "1 2 3 \xB7 Gamepad South West North \u2014 presets \xB7 Z X \xB7 C V
    \xB7 D-pad \u2014 screens \xB7 endless"
  SceneGuid: 6fc35abd6f80643aa932c8ba0c2002cb
  SceneName: CameraShakeLab
  RequiredType: xpTURN.Feedback.Samples.GameFeelLabs.CameraShakeLab, xpTURN.Feedback.Samples.GameFeelLabs.CameraShake
